OL,3,GNEWSAIce rink operator pulls out after
OL,4,Acouncil dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicester's ice rink is in doubt this
OL,7,Fyear as the longstanding operator has
OL,8,Fpulled out.
OL,10,FEleventh Hour Events has run the
OL,11,FJubilee Square attraction since 2019
OL,12,Fand was due to return in early
OL,13,FDecember.
OL,15,FIn an announcement on Friday, Leicester
OL,16,FCity Council also said it had been
OL,17,Fpursuing a debt owed by the company,
OL,18,Fwhich was now in the hands of the local
OL,19,Fauthority's lawyers alongside the
OL,20,Fbreach of contract.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
