OL,3,GNEWSAIce rink operator pulls out after
OL,4,Acouncil dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Eleventh Hour Events owner
OL,7,FJohn Davies disputes the council's
OL,8,Fclaim and is asking elected members at
OL,9,Fthe council to question its management
OL,10,Fof the situation, according to the
OL,11,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service
OL,12,F(LDRS).
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
